# Chekov and McCoy: "Whenever you put one or more +1/+1 counters on Chekov and McCoy, you may draw that many cards. Do this only
# once each turn." Requisition Raid puts a +1/+1 counter on each of Bot1's two creatures in one resolution: Chekov's ability triggers
# for the counter on him and Bot1 draws exactly one card for it, the second counter putting nothing more on him. On turn 5 a second
# Raid's counter is a new turn's, so he draws again.

